  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SeiOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Sei — a high-performance EVM-compatible L1 with 400ms finality, optimised for trading and real-time applications. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs on Sei Mainnet. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- feat: add 12 new OASIS providers — SeiOASIS, CelestiaOASIS, EclipseOASIS, PushProtocolOASIS, ENSOASIS, AlchemyOASIS, InfuraOASIS, SafeOASIS, TablelandOASIS, WakuOASIS, LivepeerOASIS, AkashOASIS (091434e)\n- feat: complete all 13 unpublished NuGet providers to publish-ready standard — READMEs, release notes, logo, metadata, copyright (0263a2b)\n- feat: complete Edge offline runtime and release automation (279c090)\n- fix: delete BerrachainOASIS (typo duplicate), fix BerachainOASIS ProviderType enum ref, clean up solution and Startup.cs (8e4eabc)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- Integrate provider capabilities and reuse deployed service configuration (8ac7f1f)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SeiOASIS",
